    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "a576c446-1cdc-32e5-9174-34d90dacf515",
                "word": "hodophobia",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0fe335b1-d9f0-3bd4-89a4-540123e05dff",
                        "entry_id": "a576c446-1cdc-32e5-9174-34d90dacf515",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A fear of or aversion to travelling."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f26d559-6ff9-4c7f-bf70-d6490b6e82fd",
                                "sense_id": "0fe335b1-d9f0-3bd4-89a4-540123e05dff",
                                "text": "The rear of traveling, technically known as hodophobia, has had a crippling effect on Laura [Mandarano]'s life."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9062ce02-cd55-457a-b88a-a4c97cbfb69e",
                                "sense_id": "0fe335b1-d9f0-3bd4-89a4-540123e05dff",
                                "text": "Connie slid into the seat beside her father-in-law. \"He still gets airsick, huh?\" / \"Hodophobia. Fear of travel, that's what he calls it.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "52c62007-105a-454d-b736-119fafae5c67",
                                "sense_id": "0fe335b1-d9f0-3bd4-89a4-540123e05dff",
                                "text": "Earl was shooting blind. \"Well, for one, you're a travel writer who is afraid to travel.\" / Stanton started dabbing his towel against his forehead. \"That is a filthy lie. I do not have hodophobia.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ff94dc2-9312-4eb5-af26-5a49487e3f1a",
                                "sense_id": "0fe335b1-d9f0-3bd4-89a4-540123e05dff",
                                "text": "She enjoys an international reputation as a specialist in hodophobia (the fear of travelling). She is often quoted in the media and has appeared in national and foreign news- papers and magazines and on radio, television and social media sites."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5c537f4-6e19-48b5-a103-b5034164b2bd",
                                "sense_id": "0fe335b1-d9f0-3bd4-89a4-540123e05dff",
                                "text": "The good news is that it's possible to work on the fear. \"Hodophobia is treatable using a number of evidence-based practices,\" [Kathleen] Brown says."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "af22978b-34e4-4c46-99fa-10b9fa515f26",
                                "sense_id": "0fe335b1-d9f0-3bd4-89a4-540123e05dff",
                                "text": "So how have they gone from wanderlust to a state of hodophobia and what can new boss Jose Mourinho do to arrest the slide?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7299ac9-4602-4954-bd34-d15edf0ae6f6",
                                "sense_id": "0fe335b1-d9f0-3bd4-89a4-540123e05dff",
                                "text": "A doctor might diagnose hodophobia based on self-assessments combined with in-office questionnaires. They will likely ask you questions about your travels on both a daily and long-term basis, along with the symptoms you experience."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
